@startuml SSD US 2.2.12 - Register Physical Resource
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
  ActorBorderColor #000000
  ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Officer
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Officer
Officer -> System : 1: starts physical resource registration
activate System
System  --> Officer : 1.1: request resource data\n(code, description, type, capacity, assignedArea, status, setupTimeMinutes, staffQualificationIds, operationalWindow)
deactivate System

Officer -> System : 2: provide requested data
activate System
System  --> Officer : 2.1: physical resource created successfully
deactivate System
deactivate Officer

@enduml
